{"seq":2,"slug":"thresholding-deployment","title":"阈值选择与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/practice/thresholding-deployment","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"阈值选择与部署\">阈值选择与部署</h1><p>检测器辛辛苦苦算出来的是一串连续的异常分数，可线上系统在某个时刻只需要一个二元决定：这条要不要报警。把分数切成判定的那一刀——阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>——往往比模型本身更决定系统的成败：阈值偏低，运营人员被误报淹没到不再看告警；阈值偏高，真正的事故在沉默中酿成。这一篇讲怎么科学地选这一刀，以及模型上线之后如何让它在概念漂移中持续可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-阈值就是那条解耦出来的刀\">核心概念：阈值就是那条解耦出来的刀</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/what-is-anomaly-detection\">基础篇</a>把检测器拆成了打分函数加阈值两部分，这一拆的工程意义此刻兑现：你可以固定一个已经训好、已经用 <a href=\"evaluation-metrics\">PR-AUC 评估</a>确认排序质量不错的打分函数，单独地、反复地调整阈值，而不必重训模型。阈值选择因此是一个独立的优化问题，它的输入是分数分布和业务代价，输出是那个临界值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>形式化地，给定分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，判定为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}(x) = \\mathbb{1}[s(x) &gt; \\tau]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。问题是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 该取多少。下面三类方法回答这个问题，从最简单到最有理论保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于分布的定阈\">基于分布的定阈</h2><h3 id=\"分位数-最朴素的起点\">分位数：最朴素的起点</h3><p>最朴素的做法是基于分位数：把训练数据里所有样本的分数排序，取第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-\\nu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分位作为阈值，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 是预期<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">污染率</a>。比如认为 1% 是异常，就取 99% 分位。它简单、无需标签，但完全依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 估得准不准，而<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>讲过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 极难估准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"统计分布-均值加若干倍标准差\">统计分布：均值加若干倍标准差</h3><p>稍进一步是基于统计分布：假设正常分数服从某个分布（如高斯），取均值加若干倍标准差为阈，本质是<a href=\"../classical-methods/statistical-parametric\">统计篇</a>的 Z 分数思想用在了分数上。它的问题在于分数分布往往严重右偏，高斯假设不成立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"极值理论-只对尾部建模\">极值理论：只对尾部建模</h3><p>更稳健的是基于极值理论（EVT）。<a href=\"../classical-methods/statistical-parametric\">统计篇</a>介绍过 POT（超门限峰值）方法只对尾部建模，用广义帕累托分布拟合超过初始门限的分数，从而外推出对应某个极小风险概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的阈值。它的妙处是不需要预设污染率，只需指定你能容忍的误报概率，且专为流式场景设计的 SPOT/DSPOT 能在线自适应更新阈值，特别适合<a href=\"../ml-deep-methods/time-series-anomaly\">时间序列</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[连续异常分数] --&gt; B{有标注验证集吗?}&#10;    B --&gt;|有| C[扫描阈值&lt;br/&gt;按业务代价优化]&#10;    B --&gt;|无| D{流式数据?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[EVT/POT 自适应定阈]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[分位数 / 统计分布定阈]&#10;    C --&gt; G[输出 τ]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[上线判定]\">graph TD\n    A[连续异常分数] --&gt; B{有标注验证集吗?}\n    B --&gt;|有| C[扫描阈值&lt;br/&gt;按业务代价优化]\n    B --&gt;|无| D{流式数据?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[EVT/POT 自适应定阈]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[分位数 / 统计分布定阈]\n    C --&gt; G[输出 τ]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[上线判定]</pre><h2 id=\"基于代价的定阈\">基于代价的定阈</h2><p>当你有一个标注验证集时，最贴近业务的做法是把阈值当成一个优化变量，直接最小化业务代价。漏报一个欺诈和误报一笔正常交易的代价通常天差地别，引入代价权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，目标是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>τ</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^* = \\arg\\min_\\tau \\big( C_{FN} \\cdot FN(\\tau) + C_{FP} \\cdot FP(\\tau) \\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.55em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中扫描一系列候选阈值，对每个算出 FN 和 FP，选总代价最小的。如果代价难以量化，退一步可以优化 F-beta 分数——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 更看重召回（宁可错报不可漏报，如医疗），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 更看重精确（宁可漏报不可错报，如骚扰用户的营销拦截）。下表对比三类定阈法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>需标签</th>\n<th>需污染率</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分位数</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>快速起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EVT/POT</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>流式、要风险控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价优化</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有验证集、代价明确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"部署架构与延迟\">部署架构与延迟</h2><p>阈值定好只是上线的一半，另一半是把检测器嵌进一个能运维的服务里。一个核心决策是批式还是流式。批式（如每小时跑一次）实现简单、吞吐高，适合容忍延迟的场景；流式（数据一条条来即时出分）延迟低但工程复杂，要求模型支持增量推理。很多系统采用 Lambda 架构折中——流式出快速近似分数，批式定期校正。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽视的点是分数归一化。<a href=\"../foundations/what-is-anomaly-detection\">基础篇</a>提过不同算法的分数不可比，集成多个检测器时必须先把分数归一化到同一尺度（如概率校准或 z-score），否则阈值无从谈起。PyOD 内置了多种分数归一化工具正是为此。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线之后-漂移与重训练\">上线之后：漂移与重训练</h2><p>模型上线不是终点。<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>埋下的概念漂移问题在这里集中爆发——正常的定义会随用户行为、季节、设备老化而变，一个静态阈值和静态模型会随时间退化。一个负责任的部署必须包含三件事。</p>\n<p>其一是监控：持续跟踪分数分布、告警量、以及（如有反馈）精确率召回率的变化，分布显著漂移就预警。其二是漂移应对：阈值可以用 EVT/POT 在线自适应，模型则需要定期重训练，节奏取决于漂移速度——从每天到每月不等。其三是反馈闭环：把运营人员对告警的复核结果回流成标签，既用于重新<a href=\"evaluation-metrics\">评估</a>，也用于优化阈值，这正是<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>所说破解无标签困境的长期手段。这套监控—漂移—反馈的运维循环，会在<a href=\"real-world-pipelines\">实战流水线</a>里组装成完整的管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阈值是把连续分数切成二元判定的一刀，得益于打分—阈值解耦，它可独立于模型反复优化，输入是分数分布与业务代价。</li>\n<li>无标签时用分位数（依赖污染率）或更稳健的 EVT/POT（只需指定可容忍误报概率、适合流式自适应）定阈；有验证集时直接最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}\\cdot FN + C_{FP}\\cdot FP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的业务代价。</li>\n<li>部署要决策批式还是流式（或 Lambda 折中），并且集成多检测器前必须做分数归一化，否则阈值无意义。</li>\n<li>上线后必须应对概念漂移：持续监控分数与告警、用 EVT 在线自适应阈值并定期重训模型、用人工反馈闭环回流标签——构成长期可用的运维循环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阈值选择与部署","id":"阈值选择与部署"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：阈值就是那条解耦出来的刀","id":"核心概念-阈值就是那条解耦出来的刀"},{"level":2,"text":"基于分布的定阈","id":"基于分布的定阈"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数：最朴素的起点","id":"分位数-最朴素的起点"},{"level":3,"text":"统计分布：均值加若干倍标准差","id":"统计分布-均值加若干倍标准差"},{"level":3,"text":"极值理论：只对尾部建模","id":"极值理论-只对尾部建模"},{"level":2,"text":"基于代价的定阈","id":"基于代价的定阈"},{"level":2,"text":"部署架构与延迟","id":"部署架构与延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"上线之后：漂移与重训练","id":"上线之后-漂移与重训练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"评估指标（PR-AUC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/practice/evaluation-metrics"},"next":{"title":"实战检测流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/practice/real-world-pipelines"}}